00:40:03.680 --> 00:40:06.890
now that I had a moment
to think it through.

00:40:06.890 --> 00:40:09.860
So this year I went, my
parents live in New York still,

00:40:09.860 --> 00:40:12.190
in the same family home that I grew up in.

00:40:12.190 --> 00:40:14.380
And I went to a temple on Rosh Hashanah

00:40:14.380 --> 00:40:16.080
and Rosh Hashanah is the
beginning of the new year

00:40:16.080 --> 00:40:17.360
and it's about creation.

00:40:17.360 --> 00:40:19.690
And then basically you have the week or so

00:40:19.690 --> 00:40:21.850
