00:40:21.850 --> 00:40:25.470
where you're supposed to
think about your life,

00:40:25.470 --> 00:40:26.360
the things that you've done,

00:40:26.360 --> 00:40:27.300
the good things that you've done,

00:40:27.300 --> 00:40:29.740
the bad things you've
done, apologize to people

00:40:29.740 --> 00:40:32.590
if you've done, whoever
you may have done harm.

00:40:32.590 --> 00:40:35.210
And I really did, so
this is the real answer

00:40:35.210 --> 00:40:37.240
to your question, I
really did that this year.

00:40:37.240 --> 00:40:39.260
I really did think about it.

00:40:39.260 --> 00:40:42.760
Probably didn't fully get there on Twitter

00:40:42.760 --> 00:40:43.593
throughout the week.

00:40:43.593 --> 00:40:46.360
I probably did drop the ball
a couple times on Twitter.

00:40:46.360 --> 00:40:48.840
But I really was very aware of that

00:40:48.840 --> 00:40:52.940
and I tried, you know, just
a few days ago at services,

00:40:52.940 --> 00:40:56.200
I really was trying to be cognizant of

00:40:56.200 --> 00:40:59.230
it doesn't necessarily matter if I believe

00:40:59.230 --> 00:41:03.030
in all of this, all of it fully.

00:41:03.030 --> 00:41:04.890
But there is value in this,

00:41:04.890 --> 00:41:07.620
this story that has
been told by my parents

00:41:07.620 --> 00:41:09.290
and my grandparents and
my great-grandparents

00:41:09.290 --> 00:41:11.140
going way back when.

00:41:11.140 --> 00:41:13.900
There must have been something
that kept this thing alive

00:41:13.900 --> 00:41:16.060
and there must have been
some reason behind it.

00:41:16.060 --> 00:41:20.130
And for me to pretend
that I'm so enlightened

00:41:20.130 --> 00:41:23.700
that I have figured out
something that is so brilliant

00:41:23.700 --> 00:41:27.080
that I could just set all that aside

00:41:27.080 --> 00:41:29.260
that it, to me that strikes
me is the worst sort

00:41:29.260 --> 00:41:33.440
of like egomaniacal hubris
that you could have.

00:41:33.440 --> 00:41:35.960
So I would be happy to
do this again next year

00:41:35.960 --> 00:41:37.077
and we can continue the conversation.

00:41:37.077 --> 00:41:39.304
The Jesus guy's still
waving at me back there.

00:41:39.304 --> 00:41:40.137
(audience laughing)

00:41:40.137 --> 00:41:40.970
- Good.

00:41:42.400 --> 00:41:44.820
I'm finding this fascinating

00:41:44.820 --> 00:41:47.101
because obviously there has been something

00:41:47.101 --> 00:41:48.860
